## GET /api/market/oi-change

OI Change

Returns the non-Index/non-ETF contracts and OI (open interest) change data with the highest OI change (default: descending).

The data updates once on trading days at around 6:45am EST in the premarket. This endpoint is heavily used to confirm how much
of volume has been translated into actual open contracts.

Date must be the current or a past date. If no date is given, returns data for the current/last market day.


### Fully resolved operation
