## GET /api/market/sector-etfs

Sector Etfs

Returns the current trading days statistics for the SPDR sector etfs.

If you are interested in building some sort of market dashboard and want to quickly
retrieve which sectors are up/down today this endpoint returns all required data to build
such dashboard/view.

----
This can be used to build a market overview such as:

![sectors etf](https://i.imgur.com/yQ5o6rR.png)


