## GET /api/market/top-net-impact

Top Net Impact

Returns the top tickers by net premium (half bullish, half bearish). Defaults to last market day.

These tickers are representing the tickers which had the most influence in the [market tide](https://api.unusualwhales.com/docs/operations/PublicApi.MarketController.market_tide).


